  "subject": "情报科学研究科_情报基础数学",
  "text": "设 $x_1, x_2, x_3, x_4$ 为实数。证明下列等式（左边为行列式）：$$\\begin{vmatrix} 1+x_1^2 & x_1 x_2 & x_1 x_3 & x_1 x_4 \\\\ x_1 x_2 & 1+x_2^2 & x_2 x_3 & x_2 x_4 \\\\ x_1 x_3 & x_2 x_3 & 1+x_3^2 & x_3 x_4 \\\\ x_1 x_4 & x_2 x_4 & x_3 x_4 & 1+x_4^2 \\end{vmatrix} = 1 + x_1^2 + x_2^2 + x_3^2 + x_4^2$$",
  "knowledge_points": [
    "行列式计算",
    "矩阵分解",
    "秩一修正",
    "矩阵行列式引理"
  ],
  "question_type": "证明题",
  "method": [
    "矩阵分解法",
    "Weinstein-Aronszajn恒等式"
  ],
  "solution_steps": [
    "识别矩阵为 $I+\\mathbf{x}\\mathbf{x}^T$ 的形式",
    "应用秩一修正公式",
    "得出结论"
  ],
  "math_structure": {
    "type": "rank_one_determinant",
    "template": "$$\\det(I + \\mathbf{x}\\mathbf{x}^T) = 1 + \\mathbf{x}^T\\mathbf{x}$$",
    "variable_count": 4
  },
  "difficulty": 3,
  "answer": [
    {
      "label": "行列式等式证明",
      "steps": [
        "矩阵可写成 $A = I + \\mathbf{x}\\mathbf{x}^T$，其中 $\\mathbf{x}=(x_1,x_2,x_3,x_4)^T$",
        "验证：$(I)_{ij}=\\delta_{ij}, (\\mathbf{x}\\mathbf{x}^T)_{ij}=x_ix_j$，故 $A_{ij}=\\delta_{ij}+x_ix_j$ ✓",
        "由矩阵行列式引理：$\\det(I+\\mathbf{u}\\mathbf{v}^T)=1+\\mathbf{v}^T\\mathbf{u}$",
        "当 $\\mathbf{u}=\\mathbf{v}=\\mathbf{x}$ 时：$\\det(A)=1+\\mathbf{x}^T\\mathbf{x}=1+x_1^2+x_2^2+x_3^2+x_4^2$"
      ]
    }
  ],
